001010|Morzek|on|0x8n2Jj7vvc6|21px|18px|Morzek's Boulder|1|As a kid, my friend Nick and I found this huge boulder perched near the rim of a steep, deep ravine in that snake valley. I think... it must have been close to town, right? Anyway, I would love to know if it's still there. Wouldn't it be something to give it a heave ho and see what she smashes below? What? Aw, I'll give you something good just for the update.|You have discovered what surely must be Morzek's spoken boulder. It appears to have fallen or been shoved many years ago. You contemplate this news and what it will mean for Morzek's childhood memories.|Oops! At least you learned not to do that again. Kinda.|As a kid, my friend Nick and I found this huge boulder perched near the rim of a steep, deep ravine in that snake valley. I think... it must have been close to town, right? Anyway, I would love to know if it's still there. Wouldn't it be something to give it a heave ho and see what she smashes below? What? Aw, I'll give you something good just for the update.<br><br>You previously declined this quest.|0|0|morzek|Locate the Sneak Valley "rim boulder" for Morzek and share the location to receive 1 "good" random armor piece|https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/questbox_top.png|https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/questbox_left.png|https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/questbox_main.png|https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/questbox_top_completed.png|https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/questbox_left_completed.png|https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/questbox_main_completed.png|30|50000|<img src="https://valorquest.net/valorquest/images/quotes.png">&nbsp;|012208|Yes, a bitter sweet update indeed. It's been many years. I wonder when it fell, or if someone else beat us to it? Ah well, thanks. As a reward, I'll let you barter any item you'd like for free. Choose wisely!|Return to Morzek to receive 1 free item|Select your free item by bartering with Morzek
